<view class="scr-head"><view class="greet">全家共同约定</view><view class="title">家庭公约</view></view>
<view class="scr-body"><view class="convention-tip">把全家认同的规则写下来。公约不是惩罚，而是彼此尊重与共同成长的约定。</view><view class="card"><view class="field-label">公约标题</view><input class="field-input" maxlength="24" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle" /><view class="field-label" style="margin-top:28rpx">公约内容</view><textarea class="convention-textarea" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：\n1. 每天认真完成自己的任务\n2. 有分歧时先好好表达\n3. 每周召开一次家庭会议" value="{{content}}" bindinput="onContent" /><view class="convention-count">{{content.length}} / 1000</view></view><view wx:if="{{updatedAt}}" class="convention-updated">最近保存：{{updatedAt}}</view><button class="btn" style="margin-top:28rpx" bindtap="save">保存家庭公约</button></view>
